## Window Management

### Floating Bar Hover Effect
```typescript
// Mouse tracking events from backend
useEffect(() => {
  const setupListeners = async () => {
    unlistenEnter = await listen<null>("mouse-entered-window", () => {
      setIsWindowHovered(true);
    });
    unlistenLeave = await listen<null>("mouse-left-window", () => {
      setIsWindowHovered(false);
    });
  };
}, []);

// CSS hover effect with anti-aliasing optimization
className={cn(
  "[will-change:width,height,transform]",
  "[backface-visibility:hidden]",
  "[transform-origin:center]",
  barState === "default" && isWindowHovered && "[transform:scale3d(1.05,1.05,1)]"
)}
```

### Window States
- **"always-on-top"**: Floating bar stays above other windows
- **"focusable: false"**: Prevents stealing focus from active app
- **"visible-on-all-workspaces"**: Available across all macOS spaces

## Performance Optimizations

### Event Cleanup
```typescript
useEffect(() => {
  const setupListeners = async () => {
    // Setup listeners
    return unlisten; // Return cleanup function
  };

  const cleanup = setupListeners();
  return () => {
    cleanup?.then(unlisten => unlisten?.());
  };
}, []);
```

### State Optimization
- Debounce rapid UI updates (100ms)
- Separate loading states for different operations
- Lazy load heavy components
- Clean up audio resources properly

